        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Fragment. Long, narrow rectangular piece. Woodblock printed in Turkey red, blue and black on natrual ground (linen warp, cotton weft). Alternating horizontal and vertical oval medallions containing putti battling with sticks or picking flowers. Interspaces filled with stylized flowers and leaves. Over two whole vertical repeats. Selvedge along right side. One worn spot."@en ;
